    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "опе\nstew\ngỗ ginge\nend\nodk Tear\n1e\na06\nculen\nreakl\nuacar\nnushro\nKaesyun\nDudA\na0\nD2\nG QUCK\nvaasu\nKaego\nerda\na SOU\nInola\nn00\nntilsergor\nосолцір\nmylobsterda\notR estebo\nSellandlar miecsdesse\nOrnga\niheargou metzes\nucumbei\nsto\nCOTTIST\nlan2\nOUX\none\nsrewisa\ngingerwie\ngarden berbsfe noaua\n3D32\narisrologybrie riCk\nhboulehmirante\nrODIC\n*chnit zi\noricookie\nmenu\nEmirates",
      "San Francisco - Dubai\nSan Francisco - Dubai\nChoose a regionally inspired meal and enjoy with our\ncomplimentary wine, beer, spirits and soft drinks.\nSnacks\nCold drinks\nHot drinks\nFrom the bar\nBeverages\nA full range of sodas and mixers\nOrange, apple, pineapple, mango and tomato juice\nStill water\nCoffee and tea\nA range of red and white wine, beer, spirits and liqueurs\nOr treat yourself to a little extra:\nMoët \u0026 Chandon Brut 200ml for USD 20\nMoët \u0026 Chandon Rosé 200ml for USD 24\nAperol Spritz 187ml for USD 4\nLight bites\nEmirates pizza\nVegetarian pizza topped with tomatoes,\nmelted cheese and oregano\nFruit and snack bars\nAvailable between meal services\nAppetiser\nMain course\nAppetiser\nBreakfast\nFresh seasonal fruit\nScrambled eggs\nServed with shredded potatoes and\nsauteed spinach\nMedu vada\nLentil fritters served with upma\nand vegetable sambar\nDanish pastry\nMain course\nDessert\nDinner\nFarro salad\nWith edamame beans, feta and rocket\nSichuan chicken\nServed with chow mein noodles, snow peas and\neryngii mushrooms\nPalak paneer\nCurried spinach and cottage cheese,\nserved with coriander rice and dal Bukhara\nFruit of the forest crumble\nBerries with custard mousse\nBread\nAll our meals are halal.\nWe're sorry if occasionally your meal choice isn't available.\nEK0226-SFODXB-Y-35B_A380\nsghall\nbale gaso"
    ],
